# Eastern Time (TZ=America/New_York). Weekdays only; the routes themselves
# skip non-trading days via the Alpaca calendar.
# screen: v_pullback_screen over the last eight loaded sessions, booked in
# screen_runs / screen_candidates before the 9:03 ET pre-market routine.
45 8  * * 1-5  tick screen 300
# regime-snapshot: after the opening range, once per day, never backfilled.
40 9  * * 1-5  tick regime-snapshot
# journal-sync: after the 15:55 time-stop and the close; rebuilds round trips
# from fills, persists the cache, mirrors orders/fills/round_trips to
# Supabase, evaluates alerts.
15 16 * * 1-5  tick journal-sync
# screen-load: after the close, once Massive's grouped daily for the session
# is final. Fills bars_daily + symbols. Fifteen minutes: the free Massive
# tier is five requests a minute and the weekly reference refresh pages.
30 18 * * 1-5  tick screen-load 900
